     "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div lang=\"SL\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Prvemu argumentu funkcije aggregate odstranite prvi stolpec, ki\nje faktor po katerem združujete.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Če je v podatkih še kak faktor, izločite tudi te.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Prvi stolpec izločite z negativnim indeksom stolpca:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">htpov[,-1]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Poskusite tole:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">htpov.agg&lt;-aggregate(htpov[,-1], by=list(hab), FUN=sum,\nna.rm=T)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Izpis iz R:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">&gt;   hab&lt;-c( &quot;zvo&quot;, &quot;omt&quot;,\n&quot;omt&quot;, &quot;omt&quot;,&quot;megt&quot;,  &quot;omt&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">&gt;   povrs&lt;-c( 6837 , 8615 , 1492 ,12978 ,13920 ,19877 )<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">&gt; htpov &lt;- data.frame(hab,povrs)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">&gt; htpov<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
