pan></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">  Group.1     x<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">1    megt 13920<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">2     omt 42962<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">3     zvo  6837<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Andrej</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<div style=\"border:none;border-left:solid blue 1.5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 4.0pt\"></div></div></div>"
