     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" lang=\"SL\">\n\n<div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Prvemu argumentu funkcije aggregate odstranite prvi stolpec, ki\nje faktor po katerem združujete.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Če je v podatkih še kak faktor, izločite tudi te.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Prvi stolpec izločite z negativnim indeksom stolpca:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">htpov[,-1]</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Poskusite tole:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">htpov.agg&lt;-aggregate(htpov[,-1], by=list(hab), FUN=sum,\nna.rm=T)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Izpis iz R:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt;   hab&lt;-c( &quot;zvo&quot;, &quot;omt&quot;,\n&quot;omt&quot;, &quot;omt&quot;,&quot;megt&quot;,  &quot;omt&quot;)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt;   povrs&lt;-c( 6837 , 8615 , 1492 ,12978 ,13920 ,19877 )</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; htpov &lt;- data.frame(hab,povrs)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; htpov</span></p><div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">   hab povrs</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">1  zvo  6837</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">2  omt  8615</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">3  omt  1492</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">4  omt 12978</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">5 megt 13920</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">6  omt 19877</span></p>\n\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; htpov.agg&lt;-aggregate(htpov[,-1], by=list(hab), FUN=sum,\nna.rm=T)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; htpov.agg</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">  Group.1     x</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">1    megt 13920</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">2     omt 42962</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">3     zvo  6837</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Slo bi tudi takole, ce naredite attach:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; attach(htpov)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">&gt; aggregate(povrs, by=list(hab), FUN=sum, na.rm=T)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">  Group.1     x</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">1    megt 13920</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">2     omt 42962</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">3     zvo  6837</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Andrej</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"></span></p>\n\n<div style=\"border-style:none none none solid;border-color:-moz-use-text-color -moz-use-text-color -moz-use-text-color blue;border-width:medium medium medium 1.5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 4pt\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div style=\"border-style:solid none none;border-color:rgb(181,196,223) -moz-use-text-color -moz-use-text-color;border-width:1pt medium medium;padding:3pt 0cm 0cm\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>\n[mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b>Ursa Koce<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, March 11, 2010 11:11 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\n<b>Subject:</b> [Rkoholiki] Aggregating data by factor</span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div><div><div></div><div>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt\">Hi!<br>\n<br>\nI&#39;m looking for a solution of a problem in aggregating data by factor.<br>\n<br>\nI have a dataframe (htpov) with two variables (hab, povrs):<br>\n<br>\n <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">  hab povrs<br>\n1  zvo  6837<br>\n2  omt  8615<br>\n3  omt  1492<br>\n4  omt 12978<br>\n5 megt 13920<br>\n6  omt 19877</span><br>\n...<br>\n<br>\nI would like to sum &#39;povrs&#39; for each level of &#39;hab&#39;. <br>\nI tried the function &#39;aggregate&#39;:<br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">htpov.agg&lt;-<span style=\"color:black\">aggregate</span>(htpov,\nby=list(hab), FUN=sum, na.rm=T)</span><br>\n<br>\nBut it doesn&#39;t work. As I uderstand, this is because function (FUN) argument\nmust be applicable to all variables in the data set?<br>\n(from decription of the function):<code><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> FUN</span></i></code><i>\n... a scalar function to compute the summary statistics which can be applied to\nall data subsets. </i><br>\n<br>\nSince &#39;hab&#39; is a factor, I have a problem ...  <br>\n<br>\nThe Error message:<br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Error in Summary.factor(c(1L, 1L, 1L,\n1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L), na.rm = TRUE) : <br>\nsum not meaningful for factors</span><br>\n<br>\nI&#39;d appreciate a suggestion about aggregating the data of different types.<br>\n<br>\nThanks,<br>\nUrsa<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n</p>\n\n</div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups\n&quot;Anonimni Rkoholiki&quot; group.<br>\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoholiki+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\nFor more options, visit this group at\n<a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237953124000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0w0shFuEV5YCY3B7AzcxRL\">http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl=en</a>.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n-- <br><font color=\"#888888\">\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Anonimni Rkoholiki&quot; group.<br>\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoholiki+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\n\nFor more options, visit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237953124000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0w0shFuEV5YCY3B7AzcxRL\">http://groups.google.com/group/rkoholiki?hl=en</a>.<br>\n\n\n</font></blockquote></div>"
